  "title": "Hearty Roasted Indian Peanut Biryani",
  "description": "A resinous and pillowy Indian dish featuring roasted peanuts, made with ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly ingredients and a mortar-pestle-pound method, this biryani is an energizing meal option.",
