      "amount": "4 cups"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat ghee in a large pan over medium heat and add cumin seeds.",
    "Add chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add chopped carrot and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add coriander powder, turmeric powder, and salt, and stir well.",
    "Add soaked and drained basmati rice and stir gently.",
    "Add water to the pan and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover the pan, and cook for 15 minutes.",
    "While the rice is cooking, grind roasted peanuts into a coarse powder using a mortar and pestle.",
    "Once the rice is cooked, fluff it with a fork and stir in the peanut powder.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
  ],
